                    {
                        "sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                        "entry_id": "fc0affaf-8e32-3653-a1f8-6074f1209050",
                        "glosses": [
                            "heel erg groot"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "79b4091e-6339-4dad-aab9-17d498e9e90e",
                                "sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                                "text": "Door de droogte is er een reuzegroot risico op bosbrand."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ef846063-1ab0-45b4-ad02-93e15c00ade1",
                                "sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                                "text": "Hij droeg een reuzegroot shirt dat tot zijn knieën kwam."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "897f7851-3f04-4c9e-a9ff-14861a7f4c41",
                                "sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                                "text": "De onderzoekers lieten hun honden razen langs de stranden van Lake Michigan. Dat is een reuzegroot meer in Amerika en Canada. Het IJsselmeer past er 50 keer in!"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "07253e5e-9465-4065-a943-38796a838c84",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc0affaf-8e32-3653-a1f8-6074f1209050",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                        "target_lang_word": "riesengroß",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "riesengroß",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                        "entry_id": "b7bf28b7-ff88-3d6d-8cc2-694cc108efe5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "sehr groß; groß wie ein Riese"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a66e77d7-ff6a-450a-b88c-484a950be25d",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                                "text": "„Der Wichser war riesengroß und nahm Graham in den Schwitzkasten, schnürte ihm beinahe die Luft ab und verstellte ihm die Sicht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "453db96b-300e-4359-bcb9-823b35ae1e65",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                                "text": "„›Diese ganze Verwirrung und das Chaos‹, sagt sie, ›genauso habe ich es mir vorgestellt. Das wird ziemlich leicht für uns, Joe, und für alle anderen ein riesengroßer, unüberschaubarer, tausendfacher Schlamassel‹, sagt sie, während sie in den Rückspiegel blickt und dann eine Hand über die Fernbedienung hält.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5472bb5-296a-422a-b071-ef1fbfe6ddb9",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                                "text": "„Nach einer einstündigen Fahrt wurde Court zu einem riesengroßen Privathaus am nördlichen Stadtrand von Sankt Petersburg gebracht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c266c3c9-462f-4a7d-9a04-e517bd702f2b",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                                "text": "„Aus seinem riesengroßen Medizinschrank nahm er die Salbe heraus, die er Precious aufgetragen hatte, als die Katze sie gekratzt hatte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09ecf74c-7e7f-4433-8c7a-409cabd3b2b2",
                                                "sense_id": "d4f48e1d-a919-31c4-ba80-b02920912bab",
                                                "text": "„Das Tier kam dicht heran, erzählte mein Großvater, und betrachtete ihn aus einem riesengroßen dunklen Auge mit einem Blick voll unschuldiger Neugier, der zu sagen schien: ›Wie konnte ein kleiner Angsthase wie du es schaffen, eine Harpune in jemanden wie mich zu bohren? Du bist mutiger, als du aussiehst!‹“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e094c556-7bd8-4593-a8c4-44d2b66a1c5c",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc0affaf-8e32-3653-a1f8-6074f1209050",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                        "target_lang_word": "gigantic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gigantic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e8c9307-c470-3340-a69b-15cd77f9e6c0",
                                        "entry_id": "0fd6f71e-1bc0-36a0-838d-3c3932acd1ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very large."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "624239e8-e18a-42d6-94c6-0c50211e5802",
                                                "sense_id": "2e8c9307-c470-3340-a69b-15cd77f9e6c0",
                                                "text": "Thou Genius of the place (this most renowned Ile)\nWhich livedst long before the All-earth-drowning Flood,\nWhilst yet the world did swarme with her Gigantick brood;"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d893b783-29d1-4085-a95b-7ef474ae7c84",
                                                "sense_id": "2e8c9307-c470-3340-a69b-15cd77f9e6c0",
                                                "text": "It is in solitude that the imagination exercises its gigantic power; and where are a woman's feelings nurtured but in solitude?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6f557100-f4f9-3d85-a370-66cc19db2d6d",
                                        "entry_id": "0fd6f71e-1bc0-36a0-838d-3c3932acd1ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excellent; very good or exciting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a655ec7e-19e7-4ee2-9b91-51f79eb88625",
                                                "sense_id": "6f557100-f4f9-3d85-a370-66cc19db2d6d",
                                                "text": "This band is going to be gigantic."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3204b4d9-9321-3a7e-8bff-db67ce8271a0",
                                        "entry_id": "0fd6f71e-1bc0-36a0-838d-3c3932acd1ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In the manner of a giant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "26a05069-6083-43e0-b023-459055eddc02",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc0affaf-8e32-3653-a1f8-6074f1209050",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                        "target_lang_word": "huge",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "huge",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e4338431-3357-32fd-bd9a-a27e92d1290c",
                                        "entry_id": "b35a7fde-6367-33d7-b61c-5d48526cdac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very large."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5e8fa5a1-a8d4-44db-9d3c-6cb00ee94896",
                                                "sense_id": "e4338431-3357-32fd-bd9a-a27e92d1290c",
                                                "text": "“I don't mean all of your friends—only a small proportion—which, however, connects your circle with that deadly, idle, brainless bunch—the insolent chatterers at the opera,[…]the chlorotic squatters on huge yachts,[…]the neurotic victims of mental cirrhosis, the jewelled animals whose moral code is the code of the barnyard—!”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "756a1c7a-cb79-452a-8b00-709ce8431997",
                                                "sense_id": "e4338431-3357-32fd-bd9a-a27e92d1290c",
                                                "text": "The huge square box, parquet-floored and high-ceilinged, had been arranged to display a suite of bedroom furniture designed and made in the halcyon days of the last quarter of the nineteenth century,[…]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2d21e2b2-f460-4cf6-99f0-c7c69240bf45",
                                                "sense_id": "e4338431-3357-32fd-bd9a-a27e92d1290c",
                                                "text": "[Rural solar plant] schemes are of little help to industry or other heavy users of electricity. Nor is solar power yet as cheap as the grid. For all that, the rapid arrival of electric light to Indian villages is long overdue. When the national grid suffers its next huge outage, as it did in July 2012 when hundreds of millions were left in the dark, look for specks of light in the villages."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "df94a0a2-df36-3de4-b4c2-0b5c9f6ea90c",
                                        "entry_id": "b35a7fde-6367-33d7-b61c-5d48526cdac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very strong, powerful, or dedicated."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "70c4504b-e424-4a9b-b81a-764fa7012faa",
                                                "sense_id": "df94a0a2-df36-3de4-b4c2-0b5c9f6ea90c",
                                                "text": "Both of my parents are huge supporters of animal rights."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be18f605-da18-3b06-8a05-8b1cd7541e75",
                                        "entry_id": "b35a7fde-6367-33d7-b61c-5d48526cdac1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very interesting, significant, or popular."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac3a2e1e-cbba-4939-bc35-1d53dc32c905",
                                                "sense_id": "be18f605-da18-3b06-8a05-8b1cd7541e75",
                                                "text": "The band's next album is going to be huge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "be4fa9d9-f27c-4d6c-ae72-8a73a776af17",
                                                "sense_id": "be18f605-da18-3b06-8a05-8b1cd7541e75",
                                                "text": "In our league our coach is huge!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a1cfb347-53fb-4de5-98db-9a69ff8ea1b6",
                        "source_entry_id": "fc0affaf-8e32-3653-a1f8-6074f1209050",
                        "source_sense_id": "7a492639-87c3-3943-9dde-68aa7325b67f",
                        "target_lang_word": "gigantesque",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gigantesque",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                        "entry_id": "9d701c80-34cd-3450-ba70-c3e6f435333a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui dépasse considérablement la taille ordinaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1397d36-8ee4-43f2-917e-f923d36f60a4",
                                                "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                                "text": "Isaac […] partit accompagné de deux gigantesques forestiers, qui devaient lui servir à la fois de guides et de protecteurs à travers la forêt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "666d2099-fd21-4adc-ac6f-9d714f1df274",
                                                "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                                "text": "C’est une verrière diaprée, une filigrane gigantesque, une parure de fête, aussi ouvragées que celles d’une reine et d’une fiancée."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8da0f4d6-2258-4b02-b3bb-7e52163da7f7",
                                                "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                                "text": "À ce tronc si court sont attachés des membres d’une longueur gigantesque : l’enjambée faite est ainsi profitable à une marche fort rapide ; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "985b49a1-ee80-47c6-a345-67d96f400a9f",
                                                "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                                "text": "Des azalées, des rhododendrons aux dimensions sénégaliennes donnent une note gaie à ce triste parc où les couleurs éclatantes étonnent, où leur taille gigantesque semble lutter de force avec les vieux remparts toujours solides."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef7a5341-5eb5-40b4-a392-16e9e17beaab",
                                                "sense_id": "03f968fc-d7dc-35b5-b46a-c0cd55da2245",
                                                "text": "[…] et le porteur de pancarte, qui indiquait les rounds, se mis à promener dans le parterre un gigantesque numéro un."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2049c342-a6c7-3c1e-bb17-39039e896f81",
                                        "entry_id": "9d701c80-34cd-3450-ba70-c3e6f435333a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui excède beaucoup les proportions ordinaires."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "39acf108-1422-4037-a142-1ef3d25f02f0",
                                                "sense_id": "2049c342-a6c7-3c1e-bb17-39039e896f81",
                                                "text": "Il y a un an, il avait accusé le Maroc, le Mouvement pour l’autonomie de la Kabylie (MAK) et le mouvement islamiste Rachad, deux organisations classées comme terroristes en Algérie, d’être à l’origine des incendies gigantesques qui ont frappé le pays."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "99cd0f7a-a84c-45a9-8491-729d24e3239d",
                                                "sense_id": "2049c342-a6c7-3c1e-bb17-39039e896f81",
                                                "text": "En examinant avec soin, en étudiant scrupuleusement, et dans les moindres détails, les ouvrages défensifs de ces temps, on comprend ces récits d’attaques gigantesques que nous sommes trop disposés à taxer d’exagération."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "59336588-da59-4073-af97-fd7aeee5651d",
                                                "sense_id": "2049c342-a6c7-3c1e-bb17-39039e896f81",
                                                "text": "[…], un récif au large, dragon gigantesque, la gueule terrifiante, l’épine dorsale et la longue queue hérissées de pointes, semble en interdire l’accès; […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "68160d6e-4a8f-4bd1-b5e4-1ba9cba0982c",
                                                "sense_id": "2049c342-a6c7-3c1e-bb17-39039e896f81",
                                                "text": "D’énormes blocs de corail éblouissants de blancheur sortaient de l’eau et semblaient les débris d’une gigantesque convulsion."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
